# Names below are optional example connectors. Empty values authorize nothing.
# A selected Skill requires its own declared name; unselected Skills require none.
# Add only names declared by your selected catalog entries, leaving examples empty.
# Copy to .env in the explicit project root on the execution host.
# Literal NAME=value; blank lines and full-line # comments are allowed.
# Optional matching quotes are stripped; no expansion, escaping, or inline comments.
# Process values override .env values, including empty process values.
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=
